    <div class="about-body">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Established since 1996 and with over twenty-nine years of experience, Scheff's Kitchens &amp; Cabinets has created functional, beautiful, and unique kitchens and cabinets for homes across Adelaide.</p>
        <p>Through consultation and a free in-home inspection, we custom build your kitchen and cabinets to suit your individual needs and lifestyle — every piece made to your specifications.</p>
        <p>We can also arrange the <em>plumbing</em>, <em>tiling</em>, <em>splashbacks</em>, and any <em>electrical</em> work needed to complete your job. Renovate with ease — let us take care of organising it all for you.</p>
        <p>A small showroom is available to visit by appointment. Come in, have a look, and see the quality for yourself.</p>
